  "priorExpiration": "1994-05-24",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Box 102.02 Composition of the Commission. The commission consists of 5 commissioners, appointed by the governor and executive council to 3-year terms. A majority of the commissioners appointed shall constitute a quorum for a meeting. One commissioner shall be elected annually as chair.\n\nSource. #4420, eff 5-24-88; EXPIRED 5-24-94\n\nNew. #6256, eff 5-25-96; ss by #10482, eff 12-5-13; ss by #14498, eff 3-1-26",
